<title>USA: Tecnol begins shipping floor suction mat.</title>
<headline>Tecnol begins shipping floor suction mat.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tecnol Medical Products Inc said Thursday that it has begun shipping its new FluidControl Floor Suction Mat to medical distributors throughout the United States.</p>
<p>The FluidControl Mat collects and disposes of potentially hazardous fluids during surgery.</p>
<p>The company said it estimates sales for this product for the next 12 months is $500,000.</p>
